Subject: [PATCH 3/3] bluetooth: expose high-rate software PCM capability

Extend the software session capability for LHDC PCM. This uses the stock
software audio path. Nov 13 compilation passed; runtime acceptance covers
V5 at 48 kHz/24-bit, with higher rates pending.

Recorded before the LineageOS 24.0 migration. See the project integration
record bringup/phase-b/LINEAGE_24_MIGRATION_20261114.zh-CN.md for companion
repository revisions and validation boundaries.

Change-Id: Iad58fa8dced3d23694cabc6eea5e7d631fa49ff6
---
 bluetooth/audio/utils/aidl_session/BluetoothAudioCodecs.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

